[[["duration"],"99abc2d4cfeaa32c","Event über 1 Woche (etwa 16. bis 23. April); die Nestersuche dauert 1–3 Stunden"],[["summary"],"790fffecaf26c314","Das Frühlings-Event von Tibia (das frühere Oster-Event). Eine Woche lang erscheinen in den Dragon Lairs Drachennester, aus denen {creature:Dragon Hatchling|Dragon Hatchlings} schlüpfen (die 25% mehr Erfahrung geben), die Hasen lassen {item:Coloured Egg|Coloured Eggs} fallen, und in den Städten sind {item:Hidden Nest|Hidden Nests} versteckt. Finde sie, um {item:Surprise Nest|Surprise Nests} mit Süßigkeiten, Schokolade, Eiern und {item:Surprise Bag (Blue)|Blue Surprise Bags} zu bekommen."],[["legend_pt"],"ae0d90d970952dbf","Mehrere Abenteurer haben ungewöhnliche Aktivität in fast allen bekannten Drachenhorsten gemeldet. In ihren Höhlen wurden viele Drachen-Eier gesichtet, und es ist nur eine Frage der Zeit, bis die nächste Generation dieser fiesen Kreaturen schlüpft..."],[["start","label"],"5cb6da2e149321a2","Beispiel: Nest im Park von Thais"],[["requirements",0],"b56d075592b306b1","Kein Mindestlevel (empfohlen 8)."],[["requirements",1],"da43154306549f9d","Ein Teil des Events ist für Free Accounts zugänglich; einige Städte mit Nestern sind nur für Premium."],[["requirements",2],"383bbed89726f2e4","Nur während des Frühlingsevents aktiv (etwa 16. bis 23. April)."],[["items_needed",0,"note"],"683de66cc43ca3de","oder ein ähnliches Werkzeug, um {item:Jungle Grass} bei 3 der 5 Nester in Ab'Dendriel zu schneiden"],[["rewards",0,"text"],"eaee7f964b1c0c94","{creature:Dragon Hatchling|Dragon Hatchlings} geben während des Events **25 % mehr Erfahrung**"],[["rewards",5,"text"],"6f5ebc1c18fe6026","Eventuell weitere Items aus den {item:Surprise Nest|Surprise Nests}"],[["tips",0],"ea3a4e92f8f6f0c8","Jede Stadt hat 5 versteckte Nester. Benutze die Tabellen unten und klicke auf die Koordinaten, um die Karte zu öffnen: Viele Nester befinden sich in Türmen oder oberen Stockwerken (z kleiner als 7)."],[["tips",1],"df2b93263b1f7306","Die Drachennester in den Dragon Lairs erscheinen erst nach dem nächsten {wiki:Server Save} wieder."],[["sections",0,"title"],"3094c8760c438018","1. Was sich während des Events ändert"],[["sections",0,"steps",0,"text"],"8cb356342758c6ac","Spring into Life hat das alte Osterevent ersetzt und enthält alles, was jenes Event hatte: Während des Events lassen {creature:Rabbit|Rabbits} {item:Coloured Egg|Coloured Eggs} fallen, die du auch bei einigen {wiki:Food Shopkeeper NPCs|Essenshändlern} kaufen kannst."],[["sections",0,"steps",1,"title"],"e068f3710d6140ed","Drachennester"],[["sections",0,"steps",1,"text"],"1a239469c356f263","In vielen {wiki:Dragon Lairs} in ganz Tibia erscheinen Drachennester, aus denen mit der Zeit {creature:Dragon Hatchling|Dragon Hatchlings} schlüpfen. Während des Events geben die Dragon Hatchlings **25 % mehr Erfahrung**. Die Nester erscheinen erst nach dem nächsten Server Save wieder."],[["sections",0,"steps",1,"warning"],"31a0a071cfcc53f9","In den Dragon Lairs findest du verschiedene Arten von {wiki:Dragons|Drachen}: Geh nicht hinein, wenn du kein Level für sie hast."],[["sections",0,"steps",2,"title"],"84f9d5b971cd3243","Nestersuche"],[["sections",0,"steps",2,"text"],"aaa492a905dfcd31","In den Städten Tibias sind {item:Hidden Nest|Hidden Nests} verteilt. Finde sie und benutze sie, um {item:Surprise Nest|Surprise Nests} zu bekommen, die du dann benutzt, um verschiedene Belohnungen zu erhalten (Süßigkeiten, {item:Bar of Chocolate|Schokolade}, Eier, {item:Surprise Bag (Blue)|Blue Surprise Bags} und möglicherweise mehr). Die folgenden Abschnitte enthalten die 5 Orte jeder Stadt."],[["sections",0,"steps",3,"title"],"bd428401593565ed","Zwischen den Städten reisen"],[["sections",0,"steps",3,"text"],"c5a7f7cccb056b5e","Um von einer Stadt in eine andere zu kommen, benutze die Boote: Sprich im Hafen mit dem Kapitän und sag {key:hi}, den Namen der Stadt (zum Beispiel {key:carlin}) und {key:yes}. Für die Rückreise nimm das Boot zurück im Hafen der Stadt, in der du bist. Einige Städte sind nur mit einem Premium-Account erreichbar. Die Schritte zu Cormaya, Fibula, Yalahar und Svargrond erklären, wie man dorthin kommt."],[["sections",1,"title"],"344c4d36b371de12","2. Versteckte Nester: Städte des Hauptkontinents"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"text"],"08c5a0f7756c6d4f","Die 5 Nester in **Thais**:"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"map","marks",0,"label"],"ac759f01236276e3","Turm am Nordtor"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"map","marks",1,"label"],"c927a3bdc9977353","Park"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"map","marks",3,"label"],"8ef5a1080ba0432e","Südostturm"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"map","marks",4,"label"],"b816c14dab12eae3","Sorcerer-Gilde (außen)"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"table","rows",0,1],"71150388b2844b20","Turm am Nordtor (3 Stockwerke höher)"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"table","rows",1,1],"c927a3bdc9977353","Park"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"table","rows",3,1],"b21d11d8c543e64a","Südostturm (2 Etagen höher)"],[["sections",1,"steps",0,"table","rows",4,1],"b816c14dab12eae3","Sorcerer-Gilde (außen)"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"text"],"b57500cd13f7998f","Die 5 Nester in **Carlin**:"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"map","marks",0,"label"],"5f58f7f7a3854343","Schachbrett"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"map","marks",1,"label"],"07cdbedabec9184c","Druid-Gilde"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"map","marks",2,"label"],"70d61a878f77720f","Schlossturm"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"table","rows",0,1],"f0760d03330c9805","Schachbrett von Carlin"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"table","rows",1,1],"684ea715d30dc3cf","Druid-Gilde (1 Stockwerk höher)"],[["sections",1,"steps",1,"table","rows",2,1],"54d59416d1467fe2","Schlossturm (Spitze)"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"text"],"161b10ccdb6f691c","Die 5 Nester in **Ab'Dendriel**. Du brauchst eine {item:Machete} (oder ein ähnliches Werkzeug), um auf dem Weg zu 3 von ihnen {item:Jungle Grass} zu schneiden."],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"map","marks",0,"label"],"5922dc1ad331b496","Tempel"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"map","marks",1,"label"],"f91ec574bb9846bc","Garten"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"map","marks",2,"label"],"3b17cdd329284677","Sumpf"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"map","marks",3,"label"],"4cda3eba808096ca","Citizenship-Portal"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"map","marks",4,"label"],"93d2936881364ad6","Obstladen"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","rows",0,1],"5922dc1ad331b496","Tempel"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","rows",1,1],"f91ec574bb9846bc","Garten"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","rows",2,1],"3b17cdd329284677","Sumpf"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","rows",3,1],"4cda3eba808096ca","Citizenship-Portal"],[["sections",1,"steps",2,"table","rows",4,1],"93d2936881364ad6","Obstladen"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"text"],"85d0315bf0ac10cd","Die 5 Nester in **Kazordoon**:"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"map","marks",0,"label"],"f4ed4b799e323dd9","Loren am Haupttor"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"map","marks",1,"label"],"8649d78d5e542935","Königliche Küche"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"map","marks",2,"label"],"1d41e17588e41ce9","Bibliothek der Halls of Sorcery"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"map","marks",3,"label"],"67a016e47782c10a","Bauernhöfe"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"map","marks",4,"label"],"8cc03b06e162b2f8","Die Schmiede"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","rows",0,1],"f4ed4b799e323dd9","Loren am Haupttor"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","rows",1,1],"8649d78d5e542935","Königliche Küche"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","rows",2,1],"1d41e17588e41ce9","Bibliothek der Halls of Sorcery"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","rows",3,1],"67a016e47782c10a","Bauernhöfe"],[["sections",1,"steps",3,"table","rows",4,1],"8cc03b06e162b2f8","Die Schmiede"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"text"],"97922d533defc425","Die 5 Nester in **Venore**:"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"map","marks",0,"label"],"b8751848ad3c6dda","Schiffswrack"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"map","marks",1,"label"],"93d2936881364ad6","Obstladen"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"map","marks",3,"label"],"c6904d3d65d4ad6b","Kampfarena"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"map","marks",4,"label"],"01ccf29c9c520a94","Rüstungsladen"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"table","rows",0,1],"b8751848ad3c6dda","Schiffswrack"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"table","rows",1,1],"93d2936881364ad6","Obstladen"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"table","rows",3,1],"0111cc71b31cacab","Kampfarena (wrestling arena, unterirdisch)"],[["sections",1,"steps",4,"table","rows",4,1],"808e0a7c44b62b30","Rüstungsladen (2 Stockwerke höher)"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"text"],"9ef7d6ca91b988ee","Die 5 Nester in **Edron**:"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"map","marks",0,"label"],"da12117de025e583","Mittlerer Kreis"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"map","marks",2,"label"],"40d8d3db0b882379","Süden"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"map","marks",3,"label"],"807ff8f5849c439b","Haus von Telas"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"map","marks",4,"label"],"6411846faf36a453","Büsche von Stonehome"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"table","rows",0,1],"da12117de025e583","Mittlerer Kreis"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"table","rows",2,1],"67e57e8edfdc5b98","Süden der Stadt"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"table","rows",3,1],"6731714ac913ad1e","Haus von Telas (1 Stockwerk höher)"],[["sections",1,"steps",5,"table","rows",4,1],"6411846faf36a453","Büsche von Stonehome"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"text"],"e2a4715b1d1acdcd","Die 5 Nester in **Cormaya**: Cormaya ist eine Insel bei Edron: Sprich am Boot im **Norden** von Edron mit {npc:Captain Seahorse} ({key:hi}, {key:cormaya}, {key:yes}). Du kommst im Nordhafen von Cormaya an, neben {npc:Pemaret}, der dich zurück nach Edron bringt ({key:hi}, {key:edron}, {key:yes})."],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",0,"label"],"fc80187fa85d085d","Im Norden von Cormaya Flats"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",1,"label"],"c5be95af97f08b39","Neben dem Teich"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",2,"label"],"d2ef7db4605ccf38","Westlich der Minen, unter einem Baum"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",3,"label"],"373ac2b05419cff2","Östlich der Minen"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"map","marks",4,"label"],"207f58142c97f65c","Unter einem Baum"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",0,1],"fc80187fa85d085d","Im Norden von Cormaya Flats"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",1,1],"5537cdc73009553d","Neben dem Teich (swimming hole)"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",2,1],"ecf91e68de99265a","Westlich der Zwergenminen, unter einem Baum"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",3,1],"bd5a2d8c682f9594","Östlich der Zwergenminen"],[["sections",1,"steps",6,"table","rows",4,1],"207f58142c97f65c","Unter einem Baum"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"text"],"f46fda523176df6a","Die 5 Nester in **Fibula**: Fibula liegt südlich von Thais: Man erreicht es zu Fuß durch den Tunnel, der südlich von Thais beginnt ({coord:32261,32385,7}), und kehrt durch denselben Tunnel zurück."],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",1,"label"],"030929feecc64292","Weststrand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",2,"label"],"241281c603eeced0","Östlich des Clanhalls von Fibula"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",3,"label"],"0665c81bec8ff90f","Oststrand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"map","marks",4,"label"],"47606240157c271a","Nördlich der Dorfbar"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","head",2],"e45951136f06bb35","Koordinate"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","rows",1,1],"030929feecc64292","Weststrand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","rows",2,1],"7ad2344272ca1d28","Östlich des Fibula Clanhall"],[["sections",1,"steps",7,"table","rows",3,1],"0665c81bec8ff90f","Oststrand"],[["sections",1,"steps",7